OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,FStormont's Sign Language Bill has been
OL,7,Fhailed as a "landmark achievement" as
OL,8,Fit completed its passage into law.
OL,10,FThe legislation recognises and
OL,11,Fpromotes both British sign language
OL,12,Fand Irish sign language and places
OL,13,Fduties on public bodies to take
OL,14,Freasonable steps to ensure that the
OL,15,Finformation and services they provide
OL,16,Fare fully accessible.
OL,18,FThis will include ensuring the
OL,19,Fprovision of free sign language
OL,20,Fclasses to deaf children and their
OL,21,Ffamilies.
OL,26,@oD@MOUoD@bO]
