PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786564067
OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,FCommunities Minister Gordon Lyons said
OL,7,Fthe legislation was a "landmark
OL,8,Fachievement for the deaf community and
OL,9,Feveryone who has campaigned tirelessly
OL,10,Fover many years to secure greater
OL,11,Frecognition and rights".
OL,13,F"The Sign Language Act is unique in
OL,14,Fthese islands, providing recognition
OL,15,Fand promotion for both British sign
OL,16,Flanguage and Irish sign language
OL,17,Fwithin Northern Ireland," he said.
OL,26,@oD@WOUsD@WO]uD@AOUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
