PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786564067
OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,F"In doing so, it reflects Northern
OL,7,FIreland's distinctive linguistic
OL,8,Fheritage and demonstrates our
OL,9,Fcommitment to ensuring deaf people can
OL,10,Fparticipate fully in society.
OL,12,F"The Act sends a clear message that
OL,13,Fsign language is valued and respected.
OL,15,F"It will help remove barriers, promote
OL,16,Finclusion and support deaf people to
OL,17,Fengage fully in everyday life.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
