PN,41904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786564067
OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,F"Again, I want to pay tribute to the
OL,7,Fdeaf community, advocacy
OL,8,Forganisations, elected representatives
OL,9,Fand all those who contributed their
OL,10,Fexperience and expertise throughout
OL,11,Fthe development of this legislation.
OL,13,F"Their determination and commitment
OL,14,Fhave been instrumental in bringing us
OL,15,Fto this important day."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
