PN,41905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786564067
OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,FThe minister said his department will
OL,7,F"continue to work closely with the
OL,8,Fdeaf community to ensure that the
OL,9,Fambitions of the Act are realised in
OL,10,Fpractice" and further announcements
OL,11,Fare to be made on the "promotion of
OL,12,Fsign language".
OL,14,FJulie Graham, director of Action Deaf
OL,15,FYouth, welcomed the forthcoming
OL,16,Fimplementation of the legislation.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@IO]sD@WOUtD@NO]
