PN,41906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786564067
OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,F"This new Act is an important piece of
OL,7,Flegislation which long term will make
OL,8,Fa significant difference to the lives
OL,9,Fof deaf children and young people, as
OL,10,Fwell as deaf adults, in Northern
OL,11,FIreland, ensuring fair access to
OL,12,Fpublic services such as education and
OL,13,Fhealth through BSL/ISL," she said.
OL,15,F"Of particular importance is the
OL,16,Fclause within the Act entitling deaf
OL,17,Fchildren, young people and their
OL,18,Ffamilies access to sign language
OL,19,Fclasses free of charge.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@XO]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/7
