PN,41907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786564067
OL,3,CStormont Sign Language Bill becomes
OL,4,Claw in 'landmark' for deaf community
OL,6,F"This is something Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fhas already been offering for the past
OL,8,F12 years and this new Act safeguards
OL,9,Fthis provision long-term, ensuring
OL,10,Flanguage deprivation amongst deaf
OL,11,Fchildren can be prevented."
